**Known for**: nostr stuff

Alex is a prominent figure in the nostr community, and an antagonist on FOSS
social media platforms generally. He developed the software used for Truth
Social, Donald Trump's fediverse thing,[[source]][0] and was banned from the
Mastodon instance he used back in 2023 for being openly
transphobic.[[source]][1][[source]][2] Alex is financially supported by [Jack
Dorsey]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('dorsey')) via the "andOtherStuff"
collective.[[source]][3]

This photo of him on the right is prominently displayed on his personal
website.

